":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109579","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109579.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109579.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Implements https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11293.\r\n\r\nThis change improves the navigation feel when panning in 3D viewports using an orthogonal projection.\r\n\r\nYou can even set `editors/3d/navigation_feel/translation_inertia` to `0.0` to match the navigation feel of the 2D editor viewport.\r\n\r\n# See it in action\r\nThe cursor no longer drifts away from the initial point (using the default editor settings):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d097bea7-2cb1-448e-be71-c4405b51ee62\r\n\r\nPanning speed is still influenced by the Maya NavigationScheme (SHIFT for a 10x speed multiplicator) and the `translation_sensitivity`, so the cursor can still drift away, but it now behaves in a more natural way.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109579/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109579/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}